> your starting point and then you can keep adding pieces of ko'e to count =
up=20
> because the original (D1) doesn't require the add ons to be su'o mei. (Fo=
r=20
> my definition, the additional restriction doesn't change anything, becaus=
e=20
> everything satisfies it so it's not really any restriction.)
